 "summary": "The statements sit at their natural level: the indexed-product lemma has no finiteness assumption, the Jacobson-lifting lemma is proved once for surjections and the quotient form is derived from it, and the semisimple and matrix cases come from the general endomorphism-ring and Wedderburn\u2013Artin results. The only overlap, the commutative `hasStableRangeLE_one_of_finite_maximalSpectrum`, was already on main and is not easy to rederive, so this PR does not add duplication.",
